From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel Vicory <dvicory@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 28 Jul 2026 11:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(workspaces): align broker task-run identities

The workspace control client activated task runs with raw Hermes task and run
ids, while worker execution requests used board-qualified broker identities.
Once workers were pinned to the correct environment, every terminal and file
operation failed the broker's exact activation comparison as stale.

Make activate, consume, capture, and import accept board context and derive all
task-run fields through the same broker_task_run encoding used by execution.
Add a regression that compares the activation payload with the trusted worker
execution envelope byte for byte.
---
